# Edge TTS (`EdgeTts/`)

**Upstream (hard requirement):** Readest’s Edge TTS client is the source of truth for handshake,
Sec-MS-GEC v2, URL/query order, headers, and speech framing. Before changing this plugin, open and
follow:

https://github.com/readest/readest/blob/main/apps/readest-app/src/libs/edgeTTS.ts

Raw-socket WebSocket upgrade (when HTTP clients get status 200 instead of 101) mirrors:

https://github.com/readest/readest/blob/main/apps/readest-app/src/libs/workersWebSocket.ts

(App host: `flow-reader` `PluginWs.kt` — keep aligned with that Workers path.)

Do not invent a parallel DRM/handshake. Port Readest; bump `plugin.json` `version` when shipping.
